    {
      "id": "R0000002_a0ea110547",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source": "Heavy and solid, this brown orb feels like a rock that has been worn smooth by a constant flow of water. On one side, there's an indentation that just fits a human hand. When activated, the bounder absorbs the user and teleports them to a nearby location within line of sight.",
      "translation": "这枚棕色圆球沉重而坚实，摸起来像一块被源源不断的水流磨得光滑的岩石。球体一侧有一处恰好贴合人类手掌的凹槽。激活后，这件跃迁会吸收用户，并将其传送至视线范围内的附近地点。",
      "metadata": {},
