    {
      "id": "R0000004_abbc502838",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source": "But despite his hard words, his eyes settle on yours. Studying. Deciding. His mouth settles into an irritated line.  \r\n\r\n\"Look,\" he says, running a hand over his stubbled scalp. \"You hide it well, but I can tell you're new here. I ent trying to offend you, but I... don't like leaving folk new to Sagus on their own. If you have questions about the city - or Circus Minor in particular - I'll answer 'em, free of charge.\"",
      "translation": "但尽管他话说得硬，他的目光却落在你身上。端详。斟酌。他的嘴抿成一条烦躁的直线。  \r\n\r\n“听着，”他说，一只手抚过布满胡茬的头皮。“你掩饰得很好，但我看得出来你是新来的。我不是想冒犯你，只是我……不喜欢让初到萨古斯的人独自待着。如果你对这座城市——或者尤其是小竞技场——有什么问题，我会回答，不收钱。”",
      "metadata": {},
      "exceptions": [],
      "issues": [],
      "diagnostics": [],
      "producer": {
        "task_id": "pilot_translate-r2-00001-5e081e9b",
        "instance": "fixture-copy-64ff3e330a324b51aa402176ccf7df05"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "R0000005_58abdf6a8a",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source": "He stares at her, chewing his lip, clearly trying to work up the courage to talk to her... to convince her of something. Finally, with a wry twist of his mouth, he turns back at you. \r\n\r\n\"Look,\" he says, running a hand over his stubbled scalp. \"You hide it well, but I can tell you're new here. I ent trying to offend you, but I... don't like leaving folk new to Sagus on their own. If you have questions about the city - or Circus Minor in particular - I'll answer 'em, free of charge.\"",
      "translation": "他盯着她，咬着嘴唇，显然正努力鼓起勇气跟她说话……想说服她什么。最后，他嘴角一歪，露出苦笑，重新转向你。\r\n\r\n“听着，”他说着，用手抚过满是胡茬的头皮，“你掩饰得很好，但我看得出你是新来的。我不是想冒犯你，只是我……不喜欢把初到萨古斯的人丢下不管。如果你对这座城市——尤其是小竞技场——有什么疑问，我会免费回答。”",
      "metadata": {},
